--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
THIRD-PARTY DATA
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The NASA Battery Data Set (https://www.nasa.gov/content/battery-data-set) is
NOT distributed with this repository and is NOT covered by this licence. It is
publicly available under the NASA PCoE data-use agreement and must be obtained
from the source. Run `python scripts/download_nasa.py` for instructions.

When the dataset is absent, the loader uses a deterministic synthetic
run-to-failure generator written for this project; all API responses depending
on it report `synthetic_fallback: true`.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SCOPE NOTE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This software is a research and educational artefact intended for
hardware-in-the-loop evaluation. It is NOT a certified battery protection
system and must not be deployed in a production vehicle. See
docs/model_card.tex, Section 4 (Ethical Considerations & Safety).
